### Inquisitive


> **Rat Tales**
>
> ⁘ Our Rememberers keep lists of names, carved in secret caves, where no human will find them. Every pup of every tribe is recorded somewhere, for the day we reclaim former glories and rebuild our libraries and archives.
> ⁘ Some of us are brave, and some of us are not, but none of us are stupid. If we cannot win a fight, we run, and so we live to tell our tales.
> ⁘ The greatest among us never die but ascend to Yume-dō as Transcendents. They are guided there by living Dreamers or by the Transcendents who passed before them. Their wisdom is never lost.


